(Dongshan Tai)

6
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:30,426
(Fei Liu)

7
00:00:31,682 --> 00:00:34,971
♪Know your limits, know your worth♪
(Luo Song)

8
00:00:36,093 --> 00:00:39,528
♪Stand strong against the raging tide♪
(Annie)

9
00:00:40,497 --> 00:00:44,164
♪Ask how many times I've lost my way♪

10
00:00:44,859 --> 00:00:48,935
♪Storms rage on the road to power♪

11
00:00:49,302 --> 00:00:52,928
♪Let old promises fade into memory♪

12
00:00:53,731 --> 00:00:58,126
♪Alone and fearless, I won't back down♪

13
00:00:58,204 --> 00:01:01,964
♪Power is a crown forged in blood♪

14
00:01:02,464 --> 00:01:08,326
♪Brotherhood is shelter from the storm♪

15
00:01:12,165 --> 00:01:15,779
=The Underworld=

16
00:01:15,780 --> 00:01:18,611
=Episode 16=

17
00:01:20,959 --> 00:01:21,760
(Dongcheng Tiger)
Lin.

18
00:01:22,319 --> 00:01:23,079
Lin.

19
00:01:28,280 --> 00:01:28,959
Where...

20
00:01:29,319 --> 00:01:30,760
Where are you going?

21
00:01:33,359 --> 00:01:34,000
Boss Che.

22
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:36,040
Stay with him for a while.

23
00:01:43,879 --> 00:01:44,680
Lin...

24
00:01:46,040 --> 00:01:47,959
I'll wait for you to come back.

25
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:11,120
Che...

26
00:03:20,039 --> 00:03:21,039
Che...

27
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:24,199
(Loyalty)
Take me with you.

28
00:03:26,960 --> 00:03:28,280
Fu, were you pretending to sleep?

29
00:03:28,439 --> 00:03:29,919
No.

30
00:03:30,840 --> 00:03:32,680
I was dreaming.

31
00:03:33,039 --> 00:03:34,280
I'm going out

32
00:03:35,639 --> 00:03:36,800
to get you some egg tarts.

33
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:38,199
Want some egg tarts?

34
00:03:38,199 --> 00:03:38,800
Yes!

35
00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:41,840
Then wait here for me, okay?

36
00:03:41,840 --> 00:03:42,400
Okay.

37
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:49,319
(Dongcheng Tiger)
Egg tarts.

38
00:03:50,360 --> 00:03:50,960
Che.

39
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:55,120
I want two.

40
00:03:57,080 --> 00:03:57,719
Two.

41
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:01,240
Got it.

42
00:04:02,240 --> 00:04:02,840
Be good.

43
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:14,240
Che's treating me to egg tarts.

44
00:04:26,319 --> 00:04:28,360
This is Che's wallet.

45
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:30,279
Che...

46
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:35,839
Wangcai.

47
00:04:37,839 --> 00:04:38,639
Che!

48
00:04:39,079 --> 00:04:40,160
Che!

49
00:04:50,240 --> 00:04:52,560
Che! Your wallet!

50
00:05:00,279 --> 00:05:01,879
Che!

51
00:05:02,279 --> 00:05:04,000
Che!

52
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:06,079
Che!

53
00:05:10,560 --> 00:05:12,279
Che!

54
00:05:13,399 --> 00:05:14,879
Che!

55
00:05:20,759 --> 00:05:22,480
Che!

56
00:05:23,319 --> 00:05:24,800
Wait!

57
00:05:25,759 --> 00:05:29,079
Che! Che! Wait!

58
00:05:30,680 --> 00:05:32,000
Che!

59
00:05:32,399 --> 00:05:33,879
Your wallet!

60
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:46,879
Che! Che!

61
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:53,959
Che!

62
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:31,959
Che!

63
00:06:32,279 --> 00:06:33,680
Che!

64
00:06:35,839 --> 00:06:36,879
Che!

65
00:06:37,439 --> 00:06:38,560
Che!

66
00:06:59,399 --> 00:06:59,920
Officer Luo.

67
00:07:01,079 --> 00:07:02,480
I wanted to ask about

68
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:04,439
the ecstasy found at the complex.

69
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:05,399
Any new leads?

70
00:07:05,800 --> 00:07:06,920
We ran some tests.

71
00:07:07,759 --> 00:07:10,000
It looks a lot like ecstasy,

72
00:07:10,199 --> 00:07:10,759
but

73
00:07:10,959 --> 00:07:12,879
it's a new drug called Yaba.

74
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:14,959
It contains methamphetamine.

75
00:07:16,079 --> 00:07:18,040
We've never seen anything like it

76
00:07:18,399 --> 00:07:19,680
in Shicheng before.

77
00:07:20,839 --> 00:07:22,600
Any leads on your end?

78
00:07:24,959 --> 00:07:25,680
Nothing yet.

79
00:07:25,680 --> 00:07:27,560
I haven't found anything new.

80
00:07:32,920 --> 00:07:33,920
But my gut tells me

81
00:07:33,920 --> 00:07:36,279
Dongshan Tai is behind this somehow.

82
00:07:43,160 --> 00:07:44,360
Cut back on the cigarettes.

83
00:07:44,879 --> 00:07:46,040
And hurry.

84
00:07:51,040 --> 00:07:52,319
Bad guy!

85
00:07:53,120 --> 00:07:53,839
Bad guy!

86
00:07:54,319 --> 00:07:54,959
Bad guy!

87
00:07:54,959 --> 00:07:55,800
Che!

88
00:07:57,839 --> 00:07:59,600
If we can find proof

89
00:07:59,600 --> 00:08:00,800
that they're trafficking drugs,

90
00:08:01,600 --> 00:08:03,639
we can push for

91
00:08:04,319 --> 00:08:05,160
harsher sentences.

92
00:08:05,879 --> 00:08:06,639
We can also

93
00:08:06,959 --> 00:08:08,959
seriously weaken their operation.

94
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:10,920
I'll get on it.

95
00:08:11,319 --> 00:08:11,959
Go. Hurry.

96
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:21,560
I-I'm not scared.

97
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:23,759
Protect Che.

98
00:08:24,279 --> 00:08:25,560
Protect Che.

99
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:41,559
There's a nail.

100
00:08:42,279 --> 00:08:42,639
Pull it out.

101
00:08:42,879 --> 00:08:43,200
Okay.

102
00:08:43,759 --> 00:08:44,279
I'll handle it.

103
00:08:54,679 --> 00:08:55,559
Che!

104
00:08:58,720 --> 00:08:59,639
Che!

105
00:09:02,320 --> 00:09:04,000
Che!

106
00:09:05,639 --> 00:09:07,120
Che!

107
00:09:08,840 --> 00:09:10,320
Run!

108
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:21,720
Che!

109
00:09:31,919 --> 00:09:34,440
Che!

110
00:09:55,840 --> 00:09:56,399
Stop!

111
00:09:56,399 --> 00:09:57,000
Let me go investigate!

112
00:09:57,000 --> 00:09:58,120
Calm down.

113
00:09:58,120 --> 00:09:58,720
No!

114
00:09:58,720 --> 00:09:59,320
Listen to me.

115
00:09:59,320 --> 00:09:59,840
I want justice!

116
00:09:59,840 --> 00:10:00,600
Listen to me.

117
00:10:01,039 --> 00:10:01,960
You can't go out there.

118
00:10:02,360 --> 00:10:04,399
If you do, by tomorrow,

119
00:10:04,399 --> 00:10:05,600
everyone will know
Dongcheng Gang's Ling Che

120
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:07,320
was meeting with the police here.

121
00:10:07,320 --> 00:10:08,159
I don't care!

122
00:10:08,159 --> 00:10:09,559
He may be Shen Yanlin's brother,

123
00:10:09,799 --> 00:10:10,799
but he did nothing wrong.

124
00:10:10,799 --> 00:10:11,919
He was a good man.

125
00:10:12,080 --> 00:10:12,919
I got him killed.

126
00:10:13,120 --> 00:10:14,240
Let me see him one last time.

127
00:10:14,240 --> 00:10:15,519
Please let me see him one last time.

128
00:10:15,519 --> 00:10:17,399
I understand. I understand.

129
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:19,240
Let me see him!

130
00:10:19,240 --> 00:10:19,759
But

131
00:10:20,320 --> 00:10:22,519
we've been working this case
for five years.

132
00:10:23,559 --> 00:10:26,000
We can't give up now.

133
00:10:27,639 --> 00:10:29,120
I'll take care of him.

134
00:10:29,519 --> 00:10:30,480
We'll get him to a hospital.

135
00:10:30,480 --> 00:10:31,799
Don't worry. He'll be fine.

136
00:10:31,919 --> 00:10:32,960
He'll be okay.

137
00:10:33,799 --> 00:10:34,279
Don't worry.

138
00:10:36,360 --> 00:10:37,360
Don't worry. Don't worry.

139
00:10:37,360 --> 00:10:38,200
It's okay. It's okay.

140
00:10:38,200 --> 00:10:39,399
Relax. Relax.

141
00:11:09,799 --> 00:11:10,720
Boss Lin.

142
00:11:30,034 --> 00:11:32,803
(Morgue)

143
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:08,960
Boss Che.

144
00:12:12,879 --> 00:12:14,200
I'd like to talk to my brother.

145
00:13:24,799 --> 00:13:25,840
When I have money,

146
00:13:27,720 --> 00:13:28,679
we'll

147
00:13:29,559 --> 00:13:30,440
live in a big house.

148
00:13:31,200 --> 00:13:32,120
We'll live like kings.

149
00:13:32,121 --> 00:13:33,640
♪I have one wish♪

150
00:13:33,770 --> 00:13:36,779
♪For us to see the same light♪

151
00:13:37,221 --> 00:13:39,263
♪Though I've never seen it either♪

152
00:13:39,298 --> 00:13:42,630
♪I think I know what it looks like♪

153
00:13:45,692 --> 00:13:47,510
♪We're all the same♪

154
00:13:47,641 --> 00:13:50,726
♪We were once lost and helpless kids♪

155
00:13:50,859 --> 00:13:53,317
♪We've hit the walls of reality♪

156
00:13:53,452 --> 00:13:57,128
♪We don't want to be covered in scars♪

157
00:13:58,672 --> 00:14:01,695
♪Through ordinary days♪

158
00:14:02,032 --> 00:14:04,717
♪I know that I'm♪

159
00:14:04,998 --> 00:14:06,678
♪Not invincible♪

160
00:14:06,679 --> 00:14:07,200
Fu.

161
00:14:08,679 --> 00:14:09,840
It's been so long

162
00:14:11,600 --> 00:14:13,159
since we really talked.

163
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:18,440
Fu.

164
00:14:20,039 --> 00:14:20,720
You know,

165
00:14:23,120 --> 00:14:24,360
since Boss Hui died,

166
00:14:27,600 --> 00:14:29,399
I haven't slept well once.

167
00:14:33,919 --> 00:14:35,120
Because I'm scared.

168
00:14:38,240 --> 00:14:39,480
I'm scared that if I lose,

169
00:14:40,879 --> 00:14:42,639
I'll end up like Boss Hui.

170
00:14:49,360 --> 00:14:50,159
I'm scared.

171
00:14:54,639 --> 00:14:56,559
I'm scared that if I'm gone someday,

172
00:14:57,639 --> 00:14:58,840
I won't be there to protect you.

173
00:15:01,879 --> 00:15:02,960
I'm scared that someday

174
00:15:04,600 --> 00:15:05,840
you'll have no one to care for you.

175
00:15:09,685 --> 00:15:11,419
♪I have one wish♪

176
00:15:11,927 --> 00:15:14,647
♪For us to see the same light♪

177
00:15:15,459 --> 00:15:17,559
♪Though I've never seen it either♪

178
00:15:17,561 --> 00:15:20,787
♪I think I know what it looks like♪

179
00:15:22,559 --> 00:15:23,519
But I never thought...

180
00:15:23,790 --> 00:15:25,492
♪We're all the same♪

181
00:15:25,887 --> 00:15:27,998
♪We were lost and helpless kids♪

182
00:15:28,000 --> 00:15:29,120
you'd leave me first.

183
00:15:30,240 --> 00:15:32,159
I shouldn't have yelled at you.

184
00:15:32,160 --> 00:15:35,275
♪We don't want to be covered in scars♪

185
00:15:36,810 --> 00:15:39,960
♪Through ordinary days♪

186
00:15:40,720 --> 00:15:43,080
What have you ever protected me from?

187
00:15:43,080 --> 00:15:45,440
I wanted to protect Lin.

188
00:15:45,441 --> 00:15:48,352
♪And sometimes I'm still afraid♪

189
00:15:50,712 --> 00:15:52,877
♪Sometimes lost, sometimes confused♪

190
00:15:52,879 --> 00:15:53,320
Fu.

191
00:15:56,440 --> 00:15:57,440
I'm sorry.

192
00:15:57,441 --> 00:15:59,365
♪But I know♪

193
00:15:59,854 --> 00:16:03,476
♪There's still a long hard road ahead♪

194
00:16:03,832 --> 00:16:06,547
♪Look up♪

195
00:16:06,810 --> 00:16:09,530
♪Gaze into the endless night♪

196
00:16:10,485 --> 00:16:14,845
♪Believe a shooting star will streak by♪

197
00:16:14,930 --> 00:16:17,370
♪And shine within your eyes♪

198
00:16:17,525 --> 00:16:20,303
♪Open your arms♪

199
00:16:20,536 --> 00:16:23,157
♪Embrace every pain you can't endure♪

200
00:16:23,159 --> 00:16:25,080
Sleeping kids

201
00:16:26,200 --> 00:16:27,360
raise their hands.

202
00:16:31,279 --> 00:16:32,639
(And keep them raised.)

203
00:16:37,150 --> 00:16:40,594
♪Our sky♪

204
00:16:41,039 --> 00:16:42,559
Sleeping kids

205
00:16:44,080 --> 00:16:45,080
raise their hands.

206
00:16:45,412 --> 00:16:48,101
♪Through ordinary days♪

207
00:16:48,225 --> 00:16:50,243
♪I know that I'm♪

208
00:16:50,959 --> 00:16:52,461
♪Not invincible♪

209
00:16:53,221 --> 00:16:56,234
♪And sometimes I'm still afraid♪

210
00:16:58,552 --> 00:17:01,534
♪Sometimes lost, sometimes confused♪

211
00:17:01,965 --> 00:17:04,258
♪Sometimes I don't know where I'm going♪

212
00:17:04,752 --> 00:17:06,521
♪But I know♪

213
00:17:07,385 --> 00:17:10,883
♪There's still a long hard road ahead♪

214
00:17:11,098 --> 00:17:13,574
♪Look up♪

215
00:17:14,196 --> 00:17:17,107
♪Gaze into the endless night♪

216
00:17:18,839 --> 00:17:19,639
Fu.

217
00:17:22,640 --> 00:17:23,839
I promise you.

218
00:17:26,400 --> 00:17:28,000
I'll avenge you.

219
00:17:28,001 --> 00:17:30,734
♪Embrace all the pain♪

220
00:17:32,078 --> 00:17:34,479
I'll become the shot-caller.

221
00:17:34,480 --> 00:17:37,182
♪And light up our sky♪

222
00:17:37,650 --> 00:17:41,014
♪Our sky♪
